<description>&lt;p&gt;Pete Hegseth, the US Pentagon chief, faces multiple impeachment resolutions from House Republicans, with Rep. Thomas Massie leading a bid and former President Trump publicly pledging support. The impeachment effort is framed by Hegseth as a political farce, while Republicans continue to push the vote. In Venezuela, President Maduro remains detained while studying religion behind bars, and his wife continues to seek his release. Venezuelan lawmakers have opened the crisis-hit power sector to private investment. The conflict environment still registers 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-it-s-a-farce-hegseth-slams-impeachment-effort&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/10/donald-trump-pete-hegseth-thomas-massie-republicans-iran-war-impeachment-midterms-latest-news-updates&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/10/pete-hegseth-impeachment-effort&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/10/us-house-begins-vote-on-motion-to-advance-impeachment-of-pete-hegseth?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOY01UNlVSYm43NkhaRFIzMEI1bVpkY0FORzUtS0YtRHAtQ2c3N0s1NzVhdkozaHZsWVo1dkRWU20yRHNhUmsyYzFQUV82M0NINE5CcEFFb2NlSGUxbGF3RjBFN2ZrQzNOUHNYaFhZdVR4aV9oVC11bi1QRS1MR2xXQ3NaTkt4T2xLWi1Fb1ZZVEttVlg3SjJ5cVFSZ1NQelk5bi1yQnduLWVtaVdvTHZxdnMyeVlRRkZBR1Q5Qg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/38100c3c-af0d-440b-8350-823c5e8c80d9?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-us-pentagon-chief-pete-hegseth-calls-imp